Package: gasexchangeR
Type: Package
Title: Processing and Fitting of Leaf Gas Exchange Curves
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Camille K. Sicangco
Maintainer: <c.sicangco@westernsydney.edu.au>
Description: Shared functions for tidying LI-6800 gas exchange output files
    and fitting A-Ci and temperature-response (Vcmax, Jmax, respiration)
    curves, extracted for reuse across multiple field study projects.
    Provides a common pipeline for reading and cleaning raw LI-6800 exports,
    fitting A-Ci curves with either the plantecophys or PhotoGEA packages,
    and fitting Arrhenius-type temperature responses to derived
    photosynthetic parameters.
Imports:
    dplyr,
    rlang,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    lubridate,
    hms,
    nlme,
    units,
    plantecophys,
    PhotoGEA,
    gasanalyzer,
    lattice,
    utils
